<Grid
  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
<Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="10"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
    </Grid.RowDefinitions>
    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
        <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
	<!--TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Text="1985-8-18" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}"/-->
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		FLASH
		<LineBreak/>
		O 10 0400Z MAR 88
	</TextBlock>
    <!--TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Text="05:00Z (06:00L)" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}"/-->

    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="FM"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="RED BANNER PACIFIC FLEET"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="TO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="CO {TaskForceName}"/>
	<TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="INFO"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="5" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}">
		10th OPERATIONAL SQN
		<LineBreak/>
		11th OPERATIONAL SQN
		<LineBreak/>
		143rd MARITIME MISSILE AVIATION DIV
	</TextBlock>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="SUBJ"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="7" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" Text="OPERATION ORDER"/>
    <TextBlock Grid.Row="9" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" FontSize="{StaticResource Font.Size.Header}" TextWrapping="Wrap">
		SECRET
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		FLASH FLASH FLASH
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		1. (S) {TaskForceName} retasked to prevent CONSTELLATION from escaping Tokyo Bay.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		2. (S) Enemy submarine threat unknown, highly unlikely US SSN managed to keep up with CONSTELLATION's high speed dash. The escorting USN submarine likely detached to screen the CVBG's flanks. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		3. (S) Enemy air threat high, 1+ squadrons A-7s and 2+ squadrons of A-6s were involved in Tokyo raid. A-6 anti-shipping strikes likely delayed due to recovery and arming cycles. Follow on strike likely from Guam's bomber wings.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		4. (S) Enemy surface threat high, CONSTELLATION CVBG consists of 2x CG, 2+ DD and 2+ FFG. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		5. (S) Hamamatsu AFB was not hit in initial attack, friendly air available from this base. Damage to NAF Atsugi unknown at this time, expect no friendly strikes from this airfield. 
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		6. (S) The enemy has appeared in a very convenient spot for us, we will likely never get a chance like this again. Make the Americans pay for their audacity. Good Luck, Comrade.
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		FLASH FLASH FLASH
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		SIGNED: Khvatov
		<LineBreak/>
		KTOF
		<LineBreak/>
		<LineBreak/>
		SECRET
		<LineBreak/>
		DECL OADR BT
	  </TextBlock>
</Grid>